#: ../../source/2-how_to/5-python_interface.md:20
#: b6a54f25c61b4d4aa381487bf0cac340
msgid ""
"`./init.sh all` initializes submodules, creates the env, and installs the "
"Python packages. Then use `./run.sh` (or `./run.sh viser`) for launchers."
msgstr ""
"`./init.sh all` 会初始化子模块、创建环境并安装 Python 包。然后用 `./run.sh`（或 `./run.sh "
"viser`）启动。"

